{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1473308578"}, "name":{"label":"jimcarrey89"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-02-26T12:40:12-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.4.4"}, "id":{"label":"13792455427"}, "title":{"label":"why even make it free"}, "content":{"label":"i saw some other review claim this app isn’t locked behind a paywall, which is TECHNICALLY true. but when they lock the feature you’re going to be using the most behind a paywall, then it may as well be. can’t make ANY repeating alarms without paying for it, so if you want to have a schedule you have to set up the app yourself manually EVERY. SINGLE. DAY. which completely defeats the purpose of even having a schedule app. the app is really good, but only if you’re willing to pay. it’s pretty much useless otherwise. the only reason this app is even free in the first place is to get you so irritated with the free version you end up getting the subscription. and the dev will probably respond with some scripted response about how they “lock advanced features”, but if you don’t think being able to repeat a task on a schedule is one of the most BASIC functions idk what to say.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
